## Preparamento do dataset

```{r}
df <- df[df$Classificacao %in% c("Controlada", "Grave"), ]

df <- df %>% 
  mutate(
    Classificacao = factor(
      Classificacao,
      levels = c("Controlada", "Grave")
    )
  ) %>% 
  select(-any_of("ID"))

df
```

